description=Metamodule that owns module mounting for stock APatch. Registers module trees into the mount_kpm engine (VFS/dcache injection, no mounts to hide); falls back to real overlayfs in the global mount namespace when the engine is unavailable. Tap Action, or open the WebUI, for status and a hot apply.
